    "title": "CopyPaste creative production matrices",
    "version": "0.5.0",
    "description": "Additive project design batch contract. Deterministic local layout; six operations, independent immutable input revisions, explicit per-unit retries and actual PNG/SVG/JSON files. Original OpenAPI remains unchanged."
  },
